---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Kellee Wynne Studios.">
  <Nav currentPage="/privacy-policy" />

  <div class="relative bg-brand-warm overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Clean warm background — no art texture -->

    <article class="relative z-10 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

        <!-- Page header -->
        <header class="text-center mb-12">
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-pink uppercase mb-3">
            Legal
          </p>
          <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-brand-dark uppercase mb-4">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <!-- Pink accent divider -->
          <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-brand-pink mx-auto mb-5 rounded-full"></div>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-dark/40">Last updated March 2026</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Prose content -->
        <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none
          prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:uppercase prose-headings:tracking-wide
          prose-headings:text-brand-dark prose-h2:text-lg prose-h2:mt-8 prose-h2:mb-3
          prose-h2:border-l-4 prose-h2:border-brand-pink prose-h2:pl-3
          prose-p:text-brand-dark/80 prose-li:text-brand-dark/80
          prose-a:text-brand-pink hover:prose-a:text-brand-pink-dark
          leading-relaxed">

          <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Kellee Wynne Studios (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) collects, uses, and protects information when you visit this website. By using this site, you agree to the practices described below.</p>

          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly, such as your email address when you opt in to receive a free guide, join a waitlist, or submit a contact form. We do not collect payment information directly &mdash; any purchases are handled by third-party platforms with their own privacy practices.</p>
          <p>We also collect basic, anonymized analytics data (such as page views and referral sources) to understand how visitors use this site. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally.</p>

          <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use your email address to deliver the content you requested (such as a free PDF guide or waitlist updates), to send occasional newsletters or course announcements, and to respond to your inquiries. We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>
          <p>Analytics data is used solely to improve the site experience &mdash; understanding which pages are most useful and where visitors come from helps us create better content for you.</p>

          <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
          <p>This site uses minimal cookies. Essential cookies may be set to keep the site functioning properly (for example, remembering your display preferences). Analytics cookies, if present, are anonymized and do not track you across other sites.</p>
          <p>You can configure your browser to refuse cookies or alert you when cookies are being sent. Disabling cookies may affect some site functionality, but the majority of content will remain accessible.</p>

          <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>We use a small number of third-party services to operate this site:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Formspree</strong> &mdash; processes contact and opt-in form submissions. Your submitted data is stored on Formspree&rsquo;s servers subject to their privacy policy.</li>
            <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> &mdash; loads web fonts for typography. Google may log your IP address as part of font delivery.</li>
            <li><strong>YouTube</strong> &mdash; some pages embed YouTube videos. If you interact with an embed, YouTube&rsquo;s cookies and privacy policy apply.</li>
            <li><strong>Social media platforms</strong> &mdash; links to Instagram, YouTube, and Pinterest are present on this site. Clicking those links is subject to each platform&rsquo;s own privacy policy.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third-party services and encourage you to review their respective policies.</p>

          <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of any personal information we hold about you. If you subscribed to our email list and wish to unsubscribe, you can use the unsubscribe link in any email we send, or contact us directly.</p>
          <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have additional rights under applicable privacy law (such as GDPR or CCPA). If you have a request or concern, please reach out and we will respond promptly.</p>

          <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your email address and associated information only for as long as it is needed to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected &mdash; for example, as long as you remain subscribed to our list or as required to complete a transaction. You may request deletion at any time.</p>
          <p>Anonymized analytics data may be retained indefinitely as it cannot be used to identify you.</p>

          <h2>7. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
          <p>This website is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

          <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or applicable law. When we do, we will revise the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page. We encourage you to check back periodically to stay informed.</p>
          <p>Your continued use of this site after any changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

          <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions, concerns, or requests related to this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please reach out:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:kellee@kelleewynne.com">kellee@kelleewynne.com</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p>We take privacy seriously and will do our best to respond to all inquiries within a reasonable timeframe.</p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
